 "id": "f3414bda-f56e-4b90-9bc8-6ab7635a2519",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "My Dream is Just to Own a Home!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "전 그냥 내 집 마련이 꿈인데요?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“Let’s break up.”\n\nIshael, a person treated as a doormat by her boyfriend and a source of money by her family.\n\nUnable to endure the distress from those around her, Ishael reaches the point of death. At that moment, she realizes that she has experienced two reincarnations. \n\n“I won’t live how I did before. \nFrom now on, I’ll be living a new life!”\n\n…is what she said, but how is she supposed to move out of her family home?\n\nAs her worries about moving out piled up, something caught the eye of Ishael, who was working as a civil servant…\n\n“Special No Cost Housing Policy for Newlyweds in Townhouses!”\n\nWhile attempting to obtain the townhouse by searching for potential marriage candidates, an unexpected person approaches Ishael. \n\n“Will you marry me?”\n\n‘Why is Sir Dylan, the empire's greatest knight, proposing to me…?’\n\nWill Ishael truly be able to gain a new life, a new family, and new happiness?"
  },
